  "label": "Welfare Dependency Tropes",
  "description": "A harmful stereotype that falsely equates Black people with dependency on government welfare programs and single motherhood, often used to dehumanize and pathologize Black communities. This trope is central to the meme's hateful message, implying that Black identity is inherently linked to economic hardship and familial instability.",
